OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam joins Ross Kemp to prepare
OL,4,Afor emergencies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales and Ross Kemp have
OL,7,Funited to help communities plan for
OL,8,Femergencies in a world the BBC
OL,9,FCelebrity Traitors star believes has
OL,10,Fbecome "more dangerous".
OL,12,FPrince William arrived in Ilminster,
OL,13,FSomerset, earlier to launch a new
OL,14,Finitiative called Ready Together, a
OL,15,FNational Emergency Trust project to
OL,16,Fhelp communities prepare for
OL,17,Femergencies, including wildfires and
OL,18,Fflooding.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
