OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1791293178
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam joins Ross Kemp to prepare
OL,4,Afor emergencies
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at the meeting where they
OL,7,Fdiscussed how residents could become
OL,8,Fmore resilient, Kemp said: "The world,
OL,9,Fto be really honest, is in a far more
OL,10,Fdangerous situation than it was 30
OL,11,Fyears ago.
OL,13,F"The more prepared we are for all
OL,14,Feventualities, the better we'll be able
OL,15,Fto cope with them."
